  "indicatorHint": "{id, select, biodiversity{Habitat quality and connectivity of green patches (BKompV biotope values, InVEST habitat quality).} air{Population-weighted pollution index from traffic, industry and heating; vegetation removes part of it.} noise{Share of residents below the 55 dB(A) daytime limit for residential areas (TA Lärm).} housing{Housing capacity relative to local jobs, and how full it is.} economy{Jobs available for residents and the budget trend.} shopping{Retail within walking distance (Huff model, 700 m).} recreation{Green space within 300 m (WHO) and summer cooling.} commuting{Mean commute distance and car share (MiD 2017 mode shares).} climate{CO2 balance of land use and traffic, plus urban heat.} flood{Share of the design storm the ground keeps instead of shedding (SCS curve number, KOSTRA design rainfall); retention tiles absorb from their surroundings.} budget{Municipal budget relative to the starting budget.} other{}}",
