  "learningConceptName": "{id, select, access{Nearby places} tradeoffs{Trade-offs} noise_distance{Distance and noise} noise_shielding{Noise shielding} exposure{People's exposure} connectivity{Connected habitats} fragmentation{Fragmentation} maturity{Nature takes time} budget_loop{The town budget loop} delay{Delayed effects} feedback{Feedback loops} mixed_city{A balanced neighbourhood} resilience{Resilience} other{City systems}}",
